// =============================================================================
// Ground: landslides, cracks, soot, dust bursts
// =============================================================================

// Landslide dust cloud and the rock riding it. One emitter each; the director
// parks a system on the slope, points emitter 0 downhill and raises its rate
// for a few seconds. [0] ColourFader, [1] Scaler.
